-- Dummy / Demo Data Seed
-- Populates the app with realistic, varied sample data so the dashboards,
-- Forms page, and FBGDSD module have something meaningful to show:
--   - 5 hospitals across the existing regions
--   - 7 extra users (regional_admin, hospital_admin x2, data_entry x3, viewer)
--     -- password for all of them: Password@123
--   - 90 FBG assessment records spread across the 5 hospitals, with realistic
--     viral-load progression, CD4/TB/disclosure distributions, and natural
--     follow-up attrition (not every patient has data at every period)
--   - 3 FBGDSD groups with members and meetings/attendance
--
-- Requires (run in this order first): mysql/001_schema.sql, mysql/002_seed.sql,
-- fbgdsd_schema.sql, fbg_schema.sql.
--
-- Safe to re-run: hospitals/users/groups/members/meetings/attendance use
-- INSERT IGNORE (skipped if already present); fbg_assessments rows have
-- randomly generated ids each run, so re-running this file adds a second
-- batch of assessments rather than duplicating failures.

SET NAMES utf8mb4;

